WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:33.070
Blue-Eyed Kisara

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.080
Mahad!

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:44.950
Master!

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:49.700
Mana…

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:55.700
Prince, I know you can summon his spirit from the tablet!

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:59.150
Please let me see my master!

00:01:59.150 --> 00:01:59.710
Mana.

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:06.700
Until Mahad’s spirit heals from its wounds, no one can summon him.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:13.950
And even if Mahad appears, you don't have enough Heka to see him.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.460
Isis…

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:18.760
You must train, Mana.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.230
To carry on his will.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:27.730
Master, I promise to become an elite spellcaster!

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.730
I promise!

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:42.180
This is my other self’s world of memories!

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:48.190
You finally found the true door.

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:51.180
I can guide you no further.

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:57.690
Only those who heard the Pharaoh’s soul can proceed.

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:03.700
Those chosen by the Millennium Puzzle, be courageous and go.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.960
But how do we go?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:11.750
Yugi!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.370
Dammit!  Let's go!

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:23.110
Did Mahad succeed in ending Bakura?

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:27.860
If Bakura escaped, he may now have the Millennium Ring.

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:35.370
But it'll take weeks to dig through the wreckage and learn the truth.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:39.100
During that time, if Bakura has the Millennium Ring...

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:45.600
Isis, did your Millennium Necklace see Bakura in the future?

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.520
No, not at all.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:51.380
Mahad failed because he wasn't ready.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:58.380
Isis, you should've predicted Mahad’s selfish actions in advance.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.380
I apologize.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:05.130
If we can't foretell Bakura's actions, what should we do?

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:12.030
I’ll send my Ka, Spiria, to the training grounds and try remote viewing.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:14.140
Thanks, Isis.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:18.370
Pharaoh, we must be extra careful.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.870
For security, let me send my forces to the city.

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:30.400
Pharaoh, no more tears of sorrow must be shed into the Nile!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:34.650
We must save the people from Bakura immediately!

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:39.600
Since we don't know whether Bakura is dead or alive, security is important.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:40.660
Understood.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:44.430
But do not scare the people.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:56.880
We're really in ancient Egypt!

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:57.890
Yeah.

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.960
Don’t we stand out dressed like this?

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:05.990
Yeah, but no one is paying attention to us.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.680
That can't be true.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:13.000
Everyone's looking at us suspiciously... or not.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.010
Told you so.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:19.250
Hey lady!  Do we look suspicious to you-

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:25.670
She passed through me!

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.190
The Millennium Puzzle is gone!

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:33.710
Because this is my other self's world of memories.

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:37.300
No one knows us in this world.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:41.920
So for these people, we don’t exist.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:47.070
So the other Yugi can't see us either?

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:53.670
I don’t know.  But if he still remembers us, he should be able to.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:04.670
Seto, do you really believe Bakura is alive?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.060
That’s a foolish question.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:09.680
His Ka's power rivals the Gods.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:12.180
You saw it yourself.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.230
Mahad died pointlessly.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:21.650
Making the situation worse.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.200
You mean the Millennium Ring.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:28.580
He’ll use the Millennium Ring to further his evil plans.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:34.370
If we don't increase our Ka, he’ll become too powerful for us to handle.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:39.380
Shada, use your Millennium Key to look into peoples' hearts.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:43.880
Find those who have powerful Ka.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.200
What!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:49.900
Even we priests aren't allowed to look into the hearts of the innocent!

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:57.130
Do you think we stand a chance against Bakura, now that he has the Millennium Ring?

00:06:57.130 --> 00:07:03.130
Do you want to endanger the Pharaoh again?  And rely on the power of the Gods?

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:05.870
Halt!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:12.620
Shada, Mahad’s actions were foolish.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:18.110
But we must follow his example and fight Bakura without relying on the Gods.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:28.860
I order you to bring anyone who seems suspicious before me!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:36.560
Still not enough…

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:40.950
I need more fear and despair!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.240
But Priest!

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:54.930
What crime have I committed?

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:59.760
You haven't committed one yet, but we'll see if you might.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.260
That's not fair!

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:03.260
Let me go!

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:08.250
Seto, we found this criminal in the tavern.

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:12.520
So we can hunt criminals too.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:15.270
Shada, check his Ka.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:20.790
Millennium Key, look into his soul.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:29.280
There's an evil Ka forming inside him.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:35.290
His Heka is weak, but he may do something bad again if we let him free.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:38.800
So he's a weakling.  But just in case...

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:40.140
Lock him up!

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:45.640
Wait!  I just came back from the desert!

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:48.820
I paid for my crimes!

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:51.810
There's a new evil Ka inside you.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:54.580
And that's a crime.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.900
That’s ridiculous!

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:59.820
If you do this to me, you'll be cursed!

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:04.860
In the desert, I saw the embodiment of God with my own eyes!

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:08.200
That's how I was able to return to this city alive!

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.340
That's right.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:12.060
The White Dragon guided me here!

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:14.560
What?  The White Dragon?

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:26.310
I know the White Dragon is in this city and watching over me!

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:29.540
The White Dragon is in this city…

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:30.900
Let’s go!

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:31.760
Seto?

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:34.820
Wait!  Or you’ll be punished!

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:38.290
The White Dragon will punish you!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.140
Wait up!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:55.560
C'mon, wait up!

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:58.540
Sheesh!  What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:01.780
I’m starving.  I can barely move.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:06.010
We're like ghosts in this world.

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:08.180
Ghosts don’t get hungry!

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:09.800
Easy for you to say!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:15.130
I’m hungry too.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.380
Honda, not you too!

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:20.600
We can’t touch anything in this world.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:24.140
That means we can't eat.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:26.300
Are you serious?

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:34.780
Something's weird about that guy.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.000
How so?

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:40.480
No one notices that he's stealing all that food.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:42.060
You’re right!

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.370
Which means…

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.160
Hey!

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:46.540
Give us that food!

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.140
Wait up!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.420
He can see us!

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.400
Give us food!

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:02.140
Dammit!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.720
Oh yeah!

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:17.150
What?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:21.900
Leave this city!

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.330
She's a witch!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.400
That’s right!

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:30.800
What do you think you’re doing!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:32.260
No bullying!

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:34.280
Or you'll have to deal with us!

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:35.420
Are you okay?

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:40.720
She can’t see us.

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:42.930
And the rocks pass through us.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.260
Isn’t there anything we can do?

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.320
What's going on?

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:49.170
No way!

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:50.660
Kaiba?

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:54.960
Kaiba!

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:13.770
What is it, Seto?

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:21.220
Her Heka is too powerful to measure!

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:25.260
Shada?

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:28.920
Someone has a Heka this powerful?

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:29.770
What?

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:34.000
She has a powerful Heka?

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.810
Lock her up immediately!

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:40.210
But give her all the food and water she needs!

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:47.000
The rest of you - leave before I arrest you!

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.770
Nice, copycat Kaiba!

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:52.240
Yugi, look!

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:57.520
They have the Millennium Rod and the Millennium Key.

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:04.010
That means he's the priest engraved on the tablet of memories.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.010
Don't tell the Pharaoh about this.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:11.290
This isn't the time to be merciful.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:14.000
Shada, let's return to the palace.

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.900
Did you hear that?  A palace!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.320
If we follow them…

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.810
We may meet my other self.

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:25.020
Then let's go to the palace!

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.320
Wow!

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:34.260
It's huge!

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:37.120
C'mon, hurry!  The gates are closing!

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.640
What now?  They're closed!

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.620
Don't worry.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.840
We're ghosts.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.920
So we can get thru-

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.860
Jonouchi!

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:57.800
What’s going on?

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:59.360
I slammed into it!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:05.370
Does this mean we can’t enter the palace?

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.760
Even Bobasa can’t enter.

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:10.980
It’s you!

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.400
I’m Bobasa.

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:16.560
You scared me earlier, but I know you're not bad people.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:21.610
Bobasa saw you protect the girl on the ground.

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:25.020
You're good people.  So…

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.490
What?

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.220
This is for you!

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:33.720
Food!

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:38.570
Why can you touch things in this world?

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:43.880
Umm…  Bobasa doesn’t know.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.140
He ate it!

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:52.620
Why can’t we enter the palace?

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:56.140
Bobasa doesn’t know.

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:02.100
He ate more!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:03.420
Why-

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:05.900
Stop asking questions, Anzu!

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:09.600
Thinking makes Bobasa hungry.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:13.010
So don’t ask him anything!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.210
Then what are we supposed to do?

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.840
Bobasa doesn't know.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.440
He'll eat it all!

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.930
My other self...

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:33.920
I want to see you.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:37.880
I heard a voice calling me.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:43.890
Everything okay?

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:44.890
Yes.

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:48.520
The moonlight allows us to spot anything unusual.

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:49.640
You're right.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:55.810
Like a bandit, I'll attack at night.

00:15:55.810 --> 00:16:01.670
This ultimate Shadow Game differs greatly from events 3,000 years ago.

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:07.780
The three God Cards were brought out when they shouldn't have.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.800
But I can deal with that.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:19.620
The Millennium Ring evolved my Diabound's effects.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:23.600
Hiding me from you.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.540
Master Aknadin.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.480
Seto.

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:36.010
The search for Ka in the city is going better than expected.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:40.540
There are citizens with incredible Ka.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:44.940
Seto, don't tell me you arrested them?

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.290
I shouldn't have?

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:49.300
Seto, it’s not too late.

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:52.290
Release the innocent immediately.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:55.640
Shameful actions breed fear.

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:59.440
And fear will lead mankind to eternal darkness.

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:00.530
Master Aknadin.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:07.030
What's this danger you speak of?  That threatens us and the people?

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:11.280
What danger is greater than the collapse of the Pharaoh’s rule?

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:16.170
Everything I've done is for the Pharaoh and for Egypt.

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:18.300
I've done nothing wrong.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.280
Seto.

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:22.700
I still have work to do.  Farewell.

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:35.700
Seto, you're going to make the same mistakes I did.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.240
You!

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:48.480
Bakura!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:51.260
How is she?

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:53.860
She's still asleep.

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:55.090
I see.

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:02.820
White hair and blue eyes.

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.850
And that's not all.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.840
Why does she make me feel strange?

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.080
Do I know her?

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:25.660
What a find.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:30.120
White hair and blue eyes are rare in these parts.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.040
We're so lucky!

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.040
Who are you?

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:40.140
Shh!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.340
I’m freeing you.  Let's go!

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.560
Hey you!

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:48.690
Let's go!

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:53.620
The girl is getting away!

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:56.240
Anyone following us?

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:57.720
No.

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.490
You can have this horse.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.650
Go alone from here!

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:04.530
You'll reach the city if you ride all night.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:07.220
Go back to your own land from there.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:09.880
Go!

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:11.160
What’s your name?

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:11.960
Seto!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.960
Thank you, Seto!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.980
Thank you!

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:27.030
That's my village...

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:31.520
Damn!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:34.750
Damn!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.320
Mom!

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.350
Keep searching!

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:41.580
Where’s the blue-eyed kid?

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:43.060
I don’t know!

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:48.040
Mom!

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:52.040
You're that kid from before!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.080
Where's the girl?

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:54.940
Outta my way!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:56.240
Wait!

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:01.180
Let me go!

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:10.190
Let me go!  Mom!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.140
What's that?

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:18.090
It’s a monster!  Run!

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:36.350
She's the girl from before.

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:39.950
And I saw a white dragon.

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:50.060
You weak old man.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:55.950
You don't have the strength to summon a single Ka before our fight is over.

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:18.780
I can easily take your Millennium Eye, but I need you to do something for me.

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:21.790
Just like 3,000 years ago.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:30.910
I know what you did at Kul Elna Village to create the Millennium Items.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:36.270
And how you abandoned your son - Seto.

00:21:59.070 --> 00:22:13.690
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:29.410
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:35.250
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:43.820
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:49.460
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:49.650 --> 00:22:57.930
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:03.740
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:11.880
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:15.140
In a duel

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:31.620
We made it to the other Yugi's world of memories.

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:36.340
But it's like we don't exist in this world.

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:38.400
We can't enter the palace.

